# The console of the people
ent-RUMCCitizenConsole = console of the people
    .desc = A terminal of the city hall for the townsfolk: write to the mayor, vote, take the orders of the city, and have a deal sealed by the notary.
rumc-citizen-title = Console of the people
rumc-citizen-subtitle = The appeals go to the mayor. The orders of the city are paid to your bank account.
